WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.066
Start by identifying the object level.

2
00:00:03.066 --> 00:00:09.038
CVE2 is both a compact family label and the repository that hosts the RTL.

3
00:00:09.038 --> 00:00:12.185
Its current named processor is CV32E20.

4
00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:22.110
CVE4 is a family grouping for several four-stage cores, but CV32E40P, CV32E40X, and CV32E40S live in separate repositories.

5
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:28.243
CVA6 is a heavily parameterized repository for several 32- and 64-bit cores.

6
00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:37.200
The longer part number narrows the implementation, but a release tag and configuration table narrow it further.

